296
00:14:10,540 --> 00:14:12,220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang ating distinct sponsor.

297
00:14:13,860 --> 00:14:15,780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

298
00:14:17,640 --> 00:14:29,500
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, in terms of the creation of the feasibility study, that is where the consultations for all local stakeholders were relevant to that particular project.

299
00:14:30,100 --> 00:14:31,800
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: That is where it's conducted.

300
00:14:33,540 --> 00:14:35,720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So, for the record, nagkaroon po ng konsulta.

301
00:14:40,540 --> 00:14:45,080
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Madam Speaker, as for the Dep-Dev.

302
00:14:46,320 --> 00:14:57,540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ilang stakeholder consultations po yung nangyari. At lahat po ba ng affected na mga sectors sa na-IA ay ating nakonsulta?

