307
00:15:21,220 --> 00:15:51,200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes, Madam Speaker.

308
00:15:51,220 --> 00:15:56,060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Abangan po natin ang ulat at submission mula sa ating distinguished sponsor at sa DepDev.

309
00:15:56,740 --> 00:16:02,140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman po ay kaugnay ng lumalaganap na privatization at mollification ng mga palengke.

310
00:16:03,020 --> 00:16:12,160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nasa palisiya ba ng pamahalaan na maipaubaya sa malalaking retailers yung pagpapaunlad ng ating public markets ngayon sa buong bansa?

311
00:16:20,560 --> 00:16:21,200
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes.

312
00:16:21,200 --> 00:16:28,640
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: But the particular circumstance of that, Madam Speaker, that would be under the purview of the local government unit.

313
